<title>USA: Reliance Steel raises div, adds payout.</title>
<headline>Reliance Steel raises div, adds payout.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Steel &amp; Aluminum Co said Friday it had raised its quarterly dividend to $0.035 a share from $0.03 and declared a special cash dividend of $0.07 per share, both payable April 4, record March 14.</p>
</text>
